          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Empathy and social skills include noticing how others feel, listening without rushing to fix, taking their perspective, disagreeing respectfully and following through, and you can build them through deliberate practice in everyday conversations and small group work."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Practise listening and perspective taking in daily conversations, ask for feedback from people you work with and record specific examples."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "If someone struggles significantly with social situations, a qualified professional can help."
          }
        ]
      },
